---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Work With Me" description="Work with Douglas M. Galloway — a thinking partner for founders and executives building something real.">
  <article class="container section">
    <h1 style="margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);">Work With Me</h1>

    <div style="max-width: 65ch; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-xl);">
      <p>Good practices generally produce good outcomes. The reverse isn't true. That single inversion is the basis of everything I do — personally and professionally.</p>

      <p>Most people who reach out have already tried the obvious approaches. The problem isn't effort or motivation. It's that the system underneath isn't designed for their actual situation — not the ideal one, not the previous one. The one they're actually running right now.</p>

      <p>That's the work. Whether it's a personal operating system that needs a rebuild, an organizational process that keeps breaking at the same point, or a decision logic that isn't producing reliable outcomes — it starts with an honest look at what's actually running.</p>

      <p>Both individual and organizational engagements start the same way. A conversation first. No proposal without one. If there's a fit, we build something together. If there isn't, you'll leave with a clearer picture of what you actually need.</p>

      <p>Tell me what you're working on.</p>

      <section style="margin-top: var(--space-lg);">
        <form action="https://formspree.io/f/xnqegrgq" method="POST" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-lg); max-width: 600px;">
          <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="New message — damdug.com" />
          <input type="hidden" name="_next" value="https://www.damdug.com/confirm" />
          <div>
            <label for="name" class="label" style="display: block; margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);">Name</label>
            <input type="text" id="name" name="name" required class="form-input" style="width: 100%;" />
          </div>

          <div>
            <label for="email" class="label" style="display: block; margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);">Email</label>
            <input type="email" id="email" name="email" required class="form-input" style="width: 100%;" />
          </div>

          <div>
            <label for="message" class="label" style="display: block; margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);">Message</label>
            <textarea id="message" name="message" required class="form-input" rows="6" placeholder="What are you working on?" style="width: 100%; resize: vertical; font-family: var(--font-mono);"></textarea>
          </div>

          <button type="submit" class="btn btn--accent">Start a Conversation</button>
        </form>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
